ss=\"subtitle\">Get it out of your head. Take it one step at a time.</p></div><button class=\"primary\" id=\"new-task\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">＋</span> New task</button></section>\n      <div id=\"storage-error\" class=\"notice\" role=\"alert\" hidden></div>\n      <section class=\"focus-workspace\" id=\"focus-workspace\" aria-labelledby=\"focus-heading\">\n        <div class=\"focus-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">ONE TASK AT A TIME</p><h2 id=\"focus-heading\">Focus timer</h2></div><span class=\"focus-state\" id=\"focus-state\">Ready</span></div>\n        <div id=\"focus-storage-error\" class=\"notice\" role=\"alert\" hidden></div>\n        <div class=\"focus-setup\" id=\"focus-setup\">\n          <p>Choose a task and make a little room for it. The timer starts at 25 minutes.</p>\n          <form id=\"focus-form\" class=\"focus-form\">\n            <label for=\"focus-task\">Task<select id=\"focus-task\" required></select></label>\n            <label for=\"focus-duration\">Duration<select id=\"focus-duration\"><option value=\"15\">15 minutes</option><option value=\"25\" selected>25 minutes</option><option value=\"45\">45 minutes</option><option value=\"60\">60 minutes</option></select></label>\n            <button class=\"primary\" type=\"submit\">Start focus</button>\n          </form>\n          <p class=\"focus-empty\" id=\"focus-empty\">Add a task to begin a focus session.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"focus-active\" id=\"focus-timer\" hidden aria-live=\"polite\">\n          <div><p class=\"focus-label\">Focusing on</p><h3 id=\"focus-title\"></h3><p class=\"focus-note\" id=\"focus-timer-note\" hidden>The timer was paused after a refresh. Resume when you’re ready.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"focus-countdown\"><span>Remaining</span><strong id=\"focus-remaining\">25m 00s</strong><small><span id=\"focus-elapsed\">0m 00s</span> focused</small></div>\n          <div class=\"focus-actions\"><button class=\"secondary\" type=\"button\" id=\"focus-pause\">Pause</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" id=\"focus-resume\" hidden>Resume</button><button class=\"text-button\" type=\"button\" id=\"focus-finish\">Finish early</button><button class=\"text-button\" type=\"button\" id=\"focus-cancel\">Cancel session</button></div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"stats\" aria-label=\"Task overview\">\n        <div class=\"stat\"><span>Open tasks</span><strong id=\"open-count\">0</strong><small>Room to make progress</small></div>\n        <div class=\"stat\"><span>Due today</span><strong id=\"due-count\">0</strong><small>A little attention today</small></div>\n        <div class=\"stat\"><span>Completed</span><strong id=\"completed-count\">0</strong><small>Every step counts</small></div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"task-workspace\" aria-labelledby=\"list-title\">\n        <div class=\"list-heading\"><h2 id=\"list-title\">Your tasks <span id=\"result-count\">0</span></h2><span class=\"list-hint\">Small steps, steady progress.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"toolbar\">\n          <label class=\"search-field\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Search task titles</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">⌕</span><input id=\"search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search task titles…\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label>\n          <label class=\"filter-label\">Status<select id=\"status\"><option value=\"all\">All tasks</option><option value=\"open\">Open</option><option value=\"completed\">Completed</option></select></label>\n          <label class=\"filter-label\">Priority<select id=\"priority\"><option value=\"all\">All priorities</option><option>High</option><option>Medium</option><option>Low</option></select></label>\n          <button id=\"clear-filters\" class=\"text-button\" hidden>Clear filters</button>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sr-only\" id=\"results-announcement\" role=\"status\"></p>\n        <ul id=\"task-list\" class=\"task-list\"></ul>\n        <div class=\"empty-state\" id=\"empty-state\"><div class=\"empty-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>✓</span><i></i><i></i></div><h3 id=\"empty-title\">A clear desk. A fresh start.</h3><p id=\"empty-description\">Add your first task and give your next step a home.</p><button class=\"secondary\" id=\"empty-action\">Create your first task <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"focus-history\" aria-labelledby=\"focus-history-heading\">\n        <div class=\"list-heading\"><h2 id=\"focus-history-heading\">Focus history</h2><span class=\"list-hint\">Actual focused time is retained here.</span></div>\n        <p id=\"focus-history-empty\" class=\"history-empty\">Your finished sessions will appear here.</p>\n        <ul id=\"focus-history\" class=\"focus-history-list\"></ul>\n      </section>\n      <footer>Less noise. More intention.<span>Your tasks stay here until you delete them.</span></footer>\n      <p class=\"toast\" id=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" hidden></p>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n  <dialog id=\"task-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"dialog-title\">\n    <form id=\"task-form\" novalidate>\n      <div class=\"dialog-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">MAKE A LITTLE SPACE</p><h2 id=\"dialog-title\">New task</h2></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-button\" id=\"close-dialog\" aria-label=\"Close task form\">×</button></div>\n      <p class=\"form-intro\">A clear next step is a good place to start.</p>\n      <label for=\"title\">Task title <span class=\"required\">Required</span></label><input id=\"title\" name=\"title\" maxlength=\"120\" required placeholder=\"What would you like to get done?\" aria-describedby=\"title-error\"><p class=\"field-error\" id=\"title-error\"></p>\n      <label for=\"notes\">Notes <span class=\"optional\">Optional · 2,000 characters max</span></label><textarea id=\"notes\" name=\"notes\" maxlength=\"2000\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"A few details, an idea, a reminder…\" aria-describedby=\"notes-error\"></textarea><p c